...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

action_agent: Action 에이전트 { class: ours }
followup_agent: Follow-up 에이전트 { class: ours }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
gpt4o: GPT-4o { class: ext }
assessment_agent: Assessment 에이전트 { class: ours }

assessment_agent -> gpt4o: 본문 지시
gpt4o -> assessment_agent: Assessment 최종 본문
assessment_agent -> action_agent: AFTER_WORK 이관
action_agent -> gpt4o: 본문 지시
gpt4o -> action_agent: Action 최종 본문
action_agent -> followup_agent: AFTER_WORK 이관
followup_agent -> gpt4o: 본문 지시
gpt4o -> followup_agent: Follow-up 최종 본문
followup_agent -> ui: max_rounds 소진, 반환(chat_history)
